From 27a0c253200b309d21751a9a0841d521792024ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:50:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-blk: submit bounded windows from the request-owned
 iovecs

Use the existing iovecs for sync and async I/O. If the byte limit falls inside a segment, restore its original length before advancing after completion or retrying a refused ring push. The kernel sees the same window boundaries without allocating or copying a second iovec table.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
